  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organizational strengthening to promote organic agriculture as a means for improving livelihoods in Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Paraguay Orgnico (PY Orgnico) will develop a strategic plan, conduct outreach activities and implement studies to increase its capacity to serve the members of its national network and to promote smallholder organic agriculture in Paraguay. PY Orgnico will also provide technical assistance to smallholder organic producers to help them improve production, marketing and sales of organic products. About 2,800 people will benefit directly and nearly 14,000 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
